{"text": "talkative", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From Middle English <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\">talkatyve</i>, equivalent to <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">talk</i> +\u200e <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">-ative</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Adjective", "definitions": [{"definition": "Tending to talk a lot.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "Speaking openly and honestly, neglecting privacy and consequences.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["UK", "/\u02c8t\u0254\u02d0k\u0259t\u026av/"], ["US", "/\u02c8t\u0254k\u0259d\u026av/"], ["cot\u2013caught merger", "/\u02c8t\u0251k\u0259d\u026av/"]]}